{"_id": "project-immonerd", "_type": "project", "name": "ImmoNerd", "company": "ImmoNerd · own SaaS", "slug": "immonerd", "dateAccomplished": "2026-11-01", "stack": ["SvelteKit", "TypeScript", "Supabase", "PostgreSQL", "Stripe", "Playwright", "Vercel"], "image": {"_type": "image", "_sanityAsset": "image@file://__SEED_DIR__/placeholders/immonerd.png"}, "content": [{"_type": "block", "_key": "k0", "style": "h2", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k1", "text": "Project overview", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k2", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k3", "text": "ImmoNerd is a multi-tenant SaaS for real estate investors: deal pipeline, CRM, investment calculations, document management, email and notifications. I have been building and running it since January 2026, from the first commit to paying customers.", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k4", "style": "h4", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k5", "text": "Architecture", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k6", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k7", "text": "SvelteKit (Svelte 5) and TypeScript on Supabase/PostgreSQL, deployed on Vercel. Tenants are isolated through row-level security in the database.", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k8", "style": "h4", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k9", "text": "Calculation engine", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k10", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k11", "text": "A calculation engine in pure TypeScript with about 120 parameters covers flip, hold and develop scenarios and is backed by 140 unit tests.", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k12", "style": "h4", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k13", "text": "LLM document processing", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k14", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k15", "text": "Uploaded PDFs are classified into one of about 40 document types and their key data is extracted. Text extraction runs first, with a multimodal fallback and a time and cost budget per scan.", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k16", "style": "h4", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k17", "text": "Email, billing and CI", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k18", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k19", "text": "Mail goes out via Gmail or Outlook (OAuth) or SMTP; replies are routed to the right deal through HMAC-signed reply-to addresses. Stripe handles monthly and annual plans, coupons and a partner program. Every pull request runs 180+ unit tests, an audit of the live Stripe configuration against the code and Playwright smoke tests against a preview deployment on its own database branch. Landing page JavaScript went down by 83% (608 KB to 104 KB gzipped).", "marks": []}]}]}
{"_id": "project-ml-annotation-platform", "_type": "project", "name": "ML annotation frontend and AWS platform", "company": "Gofore · premium automotive OEM", "slug": "ml-annotation-platform", "dateAccomplished": "2025-12-01", "stack": ["Angular", "TypeScript", "Kotlin", "PostgreSQL", "Liquibase", "AWS"], "image": {"_type": "image", "_sanityAsset": "image@file://__SEED_DIR__/placeholders/ml-annotation-platform.png"}, "content": [{"_type": "block", "_key": "k20", "style": "h2", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k21", "text": "Project overview", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k22", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k23", "text": "An ML-based HMI test automation platform for a German premium automotive OEM, built in a Scrum team.", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k24", "style": "h4", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k25", "text": "AWS infrastructure", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k26", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k27", "text": "I set up the infrastructure from scratch: ECS Fargate, EC2, S3, load balancer, Route 53 and IAM, including log monitoring and troubleshooting in production.", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k28", "style": "h4", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k29", "text": "Annotation frontend", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k30", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k31", "text": "As main owner of the Angular annotation frontend I built the tooling for placing, editing and saving bounding boxes. Test engineers used it to create training data for the ML detection models.", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k32", "style": "h4", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k33", "text": "Tests and backend", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k34", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k35", "text": "I wrote automated tests for HMI defect types that first appeared in the latest vehicle generation and monitored how well the models detected them. Backend work was in Kotlin with PostgreSQL and Liquibase migrations.", "marks": []}]}]}
{"_id": "project-thesis-plasma-simulation-gui", "_type": "project", "name": "Master's thesis: plasma simulation GUI", "company": "JLU Giessen & THM", "slug": "thesis-plasma-simulation-gui", "dateAccomplished": "2024-10-01", "stack": ["Python", "PyQt6", "C++", "GitLab CI"], "image": {"_type": "image", "_sanityAsset": "image@file://__SEED_DIR__/placeholders/thesis-plasma-simulation-gui.png"}, "content": [{"_type": "block", "_key": "k36", "style": "h2", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k37", "text": "Project overview", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k38", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k39", "text": "For my master's thesis (grade: very good) I built a cross-platform PyQt6 GUI to control a particle-in-cell plasma simulation for ion thrusters, with the simulation core in C++ and builds in GitLab CI.", "marks": []}]}]}
{"_id": "project-test-monitoring-ui", "_type": "project", "name": "Test monitoring web UI", "company": "eMundo · premium automotive OEM", "slug": "test-monitoring-ui", "dateAccomplished": "2024-09-01", "stack": ["Svelte", "TypeScript", "Tailwind CSS", "Flask", "GitHub Actions", "Docker"], "image": {"_type": "image", "_sanityAsset": "image@file://__SEED_DIR__/placeholders/test-monitoring-ui.png"}, "content": [{"_type": "block", "_key": "k40", "style": "h2", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k41", "text": "Project overview", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k42", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k43", "text": "In a five-person tooling team I designed and built a web UI for monitoring running and queued test runs. Test engineers and product managers used it every day, and its reports went into presentations for the OEM's executives.", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k44", "style": "h4", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k45", "text": "CI/CD and operations", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k46", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k47", "text": "I built and maintained CI/CD with GitHub Actions and GitLab CI, phased out the legacy Jenkins setup and migrated a complete test pipeline from GitLab CI to GitHub Actions. I also ran the Linux test servers (Grafana, MongoDB) and extended the AWS setup with Docker, Kubernetes and Helm deployments.", "marks": []}]}]}
{"_id": "project-microsatellite-rf", "_type": "project", "name": "Microsatellite RF communication", "company": "I. Physikalisches Institut, JLU", "slug": "microsatellite-rf", "dateAccomplished": "2022-03-01", "stack": ["C/C++", "ESP32", "Web interface"], "image": {"_type": "image", "_sanityAsset": "image@file://__SEED_DIR__/placeholders/microsatellite-rf.png"}, "content": [{"_type": "block", "_key": "k48", "style": "h2", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k49", "text": "Project overview", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k50", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k51", "text": "In the RF communication team of a university microsatellite I wrote ESP32 firmware in C/C++ and a web interface for telecommands and telemetry. I also assembled and integrated PCBs and built the flight model and flight spare.", "marks": []}]}]}
